#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/examples.rst:5
msgid "UDF examples"
msgstr "UDF 使用示例"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/examples.rst:7
msgid ""
"The DataFrame examples below share these four records. The ``id`` index "
"identifies the source row in the output, including when one row becomes "
"several rows. The Tensor example creates its own array."
msgstr ""
"下面的 DataFrame 示例共用这四条记录。``id`` 索引用来标识原始记录，即使一行展开成多行，也能从结果中找到对应的来源。Tensor "
"示例会单独创建数组。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/examples.rst:27
msgid ""
"Each example produces a ``result`` expression. The text block below it shows"
" the result of ``result.execute().fetch()`` in a configured MaxFrame "
"session. For connection settings, see :ref:`udf_complete_example`. Result "
"row order may differ after grouping or repartitioning."
msgstr ""
"每个示例都会生成一个 ``result`` 表达式，下方列出在已配置的 MaxFrame 会话中执行 "
"``result.execute().fetch()`` 后的结果。连接设置见 "
":ref:`udf_complete_example`。分组或重新分块后，结果的行顺序可能不同。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/examples.rst:33
msgid "Process individual values"
msgstr "逐个处理值"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/examples.rst:35
msgid ""
"Use this when each value can be handled independently, for example to "
"classify amounts or convert a field using custom rules. The function below "
"receives one amount and returns one label."
msgstr "给金额分档、转换字段这类操作，通常只需处理当前值。下面用 ``Series.map`` 给每个金额打标签，函数每次接收一个金额，返回一个标签。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/examples.rst:55
msgid ""
"For a Python function over Series values, ``Series.apply`` is another "
"option. Use ``DataFrame.map`` to apply a scalar-to-scalar function to every "
"cell; ``DataFrame.applymap`` is an alias."
msgstr ""
"对 Series 中的值调用 Python 函数，也可以使用 ``Series.apply``。如果要对 DataFrame "
"的每个单元格做相同的转换，可以使用 ``DataFrame.map``；``DataFrame.applymap`` 是它的别名。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/examples.rst:60
msgid "Process rows or columns"
msgstr "按行或按列处理"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/examples.rst:62
msgid ""
"Use ``DataFrame.apply(axis=1)`` when the calculation needs several fields "
"from the same record. Here customer A gets a 10 percent discount and "
"customer B gets a 20 percent discount. The function receives one row as a "
"pandas Series."
msgstr ""
"计算折后金额时，需要同时读取客户和金额两个字段，可以用 ``DataFrame.apply(axis=1)`` 按行处理。下面为客户 A 打九折、客户 "
"B 打八折，每行数据以 pandas Series 的形式传入函数。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/examples.rst:85
msgid ""
"With ``axis=0``, the function receives one column instead. MCSQL does not "
"support column-wise ``DataFrame.apply``, so this example explicitly selects "
"DPE. The function returns the difference between the column's maximum and "
"minimum values:"
msgstr ""
"设置 ``axis=0`` 时，函数收到的是一整列。MCSQL 不支持按列执行 ``DataFrame.apply``，因此下面的示例显式指定 "
"DPE。函数计算这一列的最大值与最小值之差："

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/examples.rst:108
msgid ""
"For this simple calculation, built-in ``max`` and ``min`` are sufficient; "
"the example shows the difference between receiving a row and receiving a "
"column."
msgstr "这个简单计算用内置的 ``max`` 和 ``min`` 就能完成，这里主要用来说明按行调用和按列调用的区别。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/examples.rst:113
msgid "Process a batch of rows"
msgstr "批量处理"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/examples.rst:115
msgid ""
"Use ``apply_chunk`` when a library or service can process several records at"
" once, such as batch model inference or vectorized pandas/NumPy operations. "
"The function receives a pandas DataFrame rather than a single row."
msgstr ""
"如果库函数或服务支持一次处理多条记录，例如模型批量推理、pandas/NumPy 向量化计算，可以使用 "
"``apply_chunk``。函数每次收到的是一个 pandas DataFrame，而不是单独一行。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/examples.rst:119
msgid ""
"Chunk sizes are not guaranteed to stay the same between executions, even for"
" the same job. A UDF should handle batches of different sizes and must not "
"depend on a particular chunk boundary."
msgstr "即使运行的是同一个作业，不同次执行的 Chunk 大小也不保证一致。UDF 应能处理大小不同的批次，不能依赖固定的分块边界。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/examples.rst:150
msgid ""
"Keep the returned pandas index consistent with the MaxFrame declaration; see"
" :ref:`udf_result_index` for the two ``index`` arguments."
msgstr ""
"函数返回的 pandas 索引需要与 MaxFrame 中的声明一致，两个 ``index`` 参数的区别见 "
":ref:`udf_result_index`。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/examples.rst:153
msgid ""
"``batch_rows=2`` makes the four-row example run in small batches. It is a "
"teaching value, not a recommended production batch size. Start with a batch "
"size that fits the function's memory needs. For ungrouped ``apply_chunk``, "
"omitting ``batch_rows`` processes each input chunk in one call in DPE; in "
"MCSQL, the default is 1,024 rows per call. See :ref:`udf_batch_rows`."
msgstr ""
"``batch_rows=2`` 是为了在四行样本中演示分批调用，不是生产环境的推荐值。实际使用时，应根据函数的内存占用选择批次大小。对于不分组的 "
"``apply_chunk``，省略 ``batch_rows`` 时，DPE 每次调用处理一个完整的输入 Chunk，MCSQL 则默认每批最多处理 "
"1,024 行。详见 :ref:`udf_batch_rows`。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/examples.rst:159
msgid ""
"``Series.mf.apply_chunk`` works similarly but passes a pandas Series. For "
"return type declarations and ``skip_infer``, see :ref:`udf_result_types`."
msgstr ""
"``Series.mf.apply_chunk`` 的用法类似，只是传入的是 pandas Series。返回类型声明和 ``skip_infer`` "
"的用法见 :ref:`udf_result_types`。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/examples.rst:163
msgid "Expand one record into several"
msgstr "一条记录展开成多条"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/examples.rst:165
msgid ""
"Use ``flatmap`` when one input record can produce zero, one, or several "
"output records. For example, split an article into paragraphs, a video into "
"frames, or a line of text into words. The function below receives one row "
"and yields one output row per word."
msgstr ""
"拆分文章段落、提取视频帧时，一条输入可能产生多条输出，也可能没有输出。这类操作可以用 "
"``flatmap``。下面把每行文本拆成单词，每个单词生成一条记录。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/examples.rst:192
msgid ""
"Each expanded row automatically repeats its source row index (``101, 101, "
"102...``). For a single text column, ``Series.mf.flatmap`` can receive one "
"text value directly. ``flatmap`` never infers output types automatically; "
"always declare ``dtypes`` (or ``dtype`` for scalar Series output)."
msgstr ""
"展开后的每行会自动保留来源行的索引，因此示例中会出现 ``101, 101, 102...``。如果只处理一列文本，也可以用 "
"``Series.mf.flatmap``，让函数直接接收一个文本值。``flatmap`` 不会自动推断输出类型，必须声明 "
"``dtypes``；Series 输出标量时使用 ``dtype``。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/examples.rst:200
msgid "Process a complete group"
msgstr "处理一个完整分组"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/examples.rst:202
msgid ""
"Use ``GroupBy.apply`` when a calculation needs all rows of each group, such "
"as fitting a model per customer or comparing each order with that customer's"
" total. This example calculates each order's share of the customer's "
"spending."
msgstr "有些计算需要一组的全部数据，比如为每个客户拟合模型，或计算每笔订单占客户总消费的比例。这时使用 ``GroupBy.apply``。下面以订单占比为例。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/examples.rst:208
msgid ""
"Pass ``prepend_index_group_keys=True`` to ``GroupBy.apply`` and grouped "
"``apply_chunk`` to prepend group keys when ``group_keys=True``. Omitting "
"this argument uses the current legacy index behavior; specify it explicitly "
"for the MultiIndex shown below."
msgstr ""
"在 ``group_keys=True`` 时，给 ``GroupBy.apply`` 或分组后的 ``apply_chunk`` 传入 "
"``prepend_index_group_keys=True``，会在结果索引前添加分组键。不传该参数时，仍使用当前的旧版索引行为。要得到下面的 "
"MultiIndex，需要显式指定这个参数。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/examples.rst:235
msgid ""
"The function receives the complete group, so its denominator is the "
"customer's total. ``prepend_index_group_keys=True`` prepends the group key "
"``customer`` to the input index ``id`` to form a ``MultiIndex (customer, "
"id)``; ``dtypes`` declares only the columns returned by ``order_share`` "
"itself. For standard aggregations such as sums and means, use built-in "
"``agg`` or ``transform`` operations."
msgstr ""
"函数收到的是完整分组，因此分母是该客户的总金额。``prepend_index_group_keys=True`` 会把分组键 ``customer``"
" 加到原来的 ``id`` 索引前，形成 ``MultiIndex (customer, id)``；``dtypes`` 只需声明 "
"``order_share`` 自身返回的列。求和、均值等标准聚合，直接使用内置的 ``agg`` 或 ``transform`` 即可。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/examples.rst:243
msgid "Process batches within a group"
msgstr "在组内分批处理"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/examples.rst:245
msgid ""
"Use ``DataFrameGroupBy.mf.apply_chunk`` when rows must be grouped by a "
"business key, but each batch can be processed independently. Each call "
"contains rows from one group. This example applies a different discount to "
"each customer."
msgstr ""
"如果数据需要先分组，而组内各批数据可以分别处理，可以使用 "
"``DataFrameGroupBy.mf.apply_chunk``。每次传入的数据都属于同一个组。下面仍按客户分组，为不同客户使用不同的折扣。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/examples.rst:278
msgid ""
"Selecting ``customer`` after ``groupby`` makes the group key available "
"inside the function. Each group has two rows here, and ``batch_rows=1`` "
"splits it into two calls. This value only demonstrates multiple calls on a "
"small sample; it is not a recommended production batch size. Results from "
"separate batches are concatenated, not aggregated into one result per group."
" Use ``GroupBy.apply`` when the function needs the complete group. The same "
":ref:`group-index requirement <udf_group_index>` applies here."
msgstr ""
"在 ``groupby`` 后选中 ``customer``，函数内才能访问分组字段。这里每组有两行，``batch_rows=1`` "
"会把每组分成两次调用。这个值只是为了在小样本中展示分批调用，不是生产环境的推荐值。各批结果会拼接在一起，不会自动聚合成每组一条结果。需要完整分组时应使用"
" ``GroupBy.apply``。这里同样需要遵守 :ref:`分组索引的设置要求 <udf_group_index>`。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/examples.rst:287
msgid "Transform and aggregate by key"
msgstr "先转换，再按键聚合"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/examples.rst:289
msgid ""
"Use ``DataFrame.mf.map_reduce`` to produce intermediate records and then "
"combine records with the same key. This example splits text into words and "
"counts each word across all rows."
msgstr ""
"统计词频需要先把文本拆成单词，再把相同单词的计数加起来。像这样包含转换和汇总两个阶段的计算，可以用 "
"``DataFrame.mf.map_reduce``。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/examples.rst:293
msgid "The reducer below accumulates a count over several calls:"
msgstr "下面的 reducer 会跨多次调用累计计数："

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/examples.rst:295
msgid ""
"It selects ``engine=\"MCSQL\"`` because this example uses the MCSQL "
"reducer's ``end=True`` signal for the last batch of a key."
msgstr "这里指定 ``engine=\"MCSQL\"``，因为示例通过 MCSQL reducer 的 ``end=True`` 判断当前分组是否已到最后一批。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/examples.rst:297
msgid ""
"With ``end=False``, it adds the current batch to the total and returns an "
"empty DataFrame with the declared columns and dtypes."
msgstr "``end=False`` 时，累加当前批次的计数，并返回列名和类型都符合声明的空 DataFrame。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/examples.rst:299
msgid ""
"With ``end=True``, it returns the total and resets ``self.total`` to zero. "
"The same reducer instance can then process another word."
msgstr "``end=True`` 时，返回累计结果，并把 ``self.total`` 清零。同一个 reducer 实例随后可以继续处理下一个词。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/examples.rst:351
msgid ""
"Here ``batch_rows=2`` demonstrates batching in both stages. Use a larger "
"value for larger data, chosen according to memory use. ``mapper_batch_rows``"
" and ``reducer_batch_rows`` set the two stages separately. "
"``ignore_index=True`` resets the index of the final ``map_reduce`` result."
msgstr ""
"``batch_rows=2`` "
"用来演示两个阶段的分批处理。实际数据量较大时，应结合内存使用情况选择更大的值。``mapper_batch_rows`` 和 "
"``reducer_batch_rows`` 可以分别设置两个阶段的批大小。``ignore_index=True`` 会重置 "
"``map_reduce`` 最终结果的索引。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/examples.rst:356
msgid ""
"``mapper_index`` and ``reducer_index`` declare the index types, not the "
"actual row labels. The mapper expands each input row into several word rows,"
" so its index template is an empty integer index named ``id``, rather than "
"``df.index``."
msgstr ""
"``mapper_index`` 和 ``reducer_index`` 声明索引类型，不指定实际的行标签。mapper "
"会把一行文本展开成多行单词，因此用一个名为 ``id`` 的空整数索引作为模板，不能直接传入 ``df.index``。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/examples.rst:362
msgid "Process array chunks"
msgstr "按块处理多维数组"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/examples.rst:364
msgid ""
"Use ``Tensor.mf.apply_chunk`` to apply NumPy or other array-processing code "
"to each Tensor block. The function receives an array block, not a pandas "
"object. This example clips values into the range from 0 to 1."
msgstr ""
"处理 Tensor 中的多维数组时，可以通过 ``Tensor.mf.apply_chunk`` 对各个数据块调用 NumPy "
"等数组处理函数。传入的是数组块，不是 pandas 对象。下面将数值限制在 0 到 1 之间。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/examples.rst:385
msgid ""
"Each block is processed independently; a function cannot assume that it "
"receives the entire Tensor. ``elementwise=True`` declares that each value is"
" processed independently and the input shape is preserved."
msgstr "每个数组块会分别处理，函数不能假设收到的是整个 Tensor。``elementwise=True`` 表示逐元素计算，并且结果保持输入的形状。"
